WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.570
-After a week
of horrific attacks,

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.371
President Trump has once again
attacked the media

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.406
while his allies blame
both sides for violent rhetoric.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.642
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look".

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:10.844
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.849
In moments of crisis like this,

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.651
it is clear that Trump is not
only incapable of providing

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.820
the moral leadership
expected of a president,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.788
he's just incapable
of being human.

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:24.290
I mean, look at him.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.126
The guy doesn't even know how to
close an umbrella.

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.295
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.833
And then when he can't close it,
he just leaves it there.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.103
Trump's the kind
of rich [bleep]

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.804
who, when his car
runs out of gas,

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:41.641
just leaves it
on the side of the road.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.475
[ Imitates Trump ] It's me.
The Bentley is broken.

00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:46.545
No, it's broken again.

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:48.514
[ Normal ] Before Trump
put the umbrella down,

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.082
he spent ten minutes
just yelling at it.

00:00:50.082 --> 00:00:52.818
[ Imitates Trump ]
Umbrella, close.

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.821
Siri, close umbrella.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.657
Alexa, fire Siri.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.992
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.694
[ Normal ] In fact, Trump
is so incapable of mustering

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.262
even the basic level of empathy

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:05.264
that after the horrific
anti-Semitic attack

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.133
at a synagogue in Pittsburgh
on Saturday,

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.568
he decided to keep all of
his political events,

00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:11.137
and at one event,
he told the crowd

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.440
he had considered canceling
not because of the attack,

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.475
but because his hair was wet.

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:18.777
-Somebody just said, "Your hair
looks different today".

00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:23.916
I said, "Well, I was standing
under the wing of Air Force One

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.852
doing a news conference
early this morning --

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.320
a very unfortunate news
conference --

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:29.823
and the wind was blowing,

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.958
and the rain,
and I was soaking wet,

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.027
and that's what
I ended up with today".

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:37.230
[ Audience yells, cheers ]

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:42.168
And I said, "At least you
know it's mine".

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.537
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.009
I said, "Maybe I should cancel
this arrangement

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.044
because I have
a bad hair day".

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:54.613
-Oh, oh, oh, your hair got wet?

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:56.782
Well, next time
just use an umbrella --

00:01:56.782 --> 00:01:59.419
Oh, no, no, I'm sorry.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.220
That's on me.
That's my fault.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.823
Trump also refused to cancel
his campaign rally on Saturday,

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.291
and to justify that choice,

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.093
he claimed that
the New York Stock Exchange

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.095
reopened the day after 9/11.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.497
-With what happened early today,

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:15.201
that horrible, horrible attack
in Pittsburgh,

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:18.337
I was saying maybe
I should cancel both,

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:20.239
this and that,

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:21.807
and then I said to myself,

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.843
I remember Dick Grasso,
a friend of mine, great guy.

00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:26.879
He headed up
the New York Stock Exchange,

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.747
on September 11th,

00:02:28.747 --> 00:02:30.516
and the New York Stock Exchange

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:33.453
was open the following day,
he said,

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.054
and what they had to do
to open it,

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.056
you wouldn't believe.
-That's right.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.724
You wouldn't believe it,
and you shouldn't

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:39.926
because it didn't happen.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:40.960
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.461
The Stock Exchange
remained closed

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:44.998
for six days after
the terrorist attacks.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.499
These are --

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:49.268
[ Applause ]

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:51.804
These are
his most infuriating lies,

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.607
the ones we can just check
by typing them into Google,

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.876
the ones his supporters
will never check.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.779
At this point, if you type
"Is Trump lying" into Google,

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:01.280
you'll just get a page
that says,

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.083
"Too many results. Try Bing".

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.685
Trump just lies freely.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:07.487
He imbibes conspiracy theories

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:09.121
from media outlets
like Fox News,

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:10.856
and then he spews them
to his supporters.

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:13.392
For example,
after mail bombs were sent

00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:15.194
to a dozen targets
of Trump's rhetoric,

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:17.096
including
leading Democrats and CNN,

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.131
prominent conservatives
on Twitter and Fox News

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:20.300
began floating the theory

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.535
that the bombs were
a so-called false flag

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.337
meant to
help Democrats in the midterms.

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:26.205
-Fox Business Network host
Lou Dobbs

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:27.874
sent out this tweet,
writing,

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.775
"Fake news, fake bombs.

00:03:29.775 --> 00:03:32.878
Who could possibly benefit
by so much fakery?"

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:36.315
-We have the worst right-wing
bomb maker in history,

00:03:36.315 --> 00:03:39.051
or we have
a false flag operation.

00:03:39.051 --> 00:03:41.520
-The fact that these bombs
have not gone off

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.890
is a great indication

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.559
that I feel these are
false flag bombings.

00:03:47.559 --> 00:03:52.031
-At the risk of sounding like
a far right-wing lunatic,

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.899
I have to say that I believe

00:03:53.899 --> 00:03:57.003
that this whole thing
was an elaborate hoax.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.172
-Of course, the other one
is that false flag,

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:00.739
and there could be
someone in there,

00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:03.909
some Democrat,
low-level person --

00:04:03.909 --> 00:04:05.645
I'm not suggesting
anyone on the top --

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:07.279
but who just decided,
"You know what?

00:04:07.279 --> 00:04:08.314
I'm going to put this out

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:10.783
because two weeks
before a major election,

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:12.251
who's going to look
like the bad guy here?

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:15.387
The Republicans".

00:04:15.387 --> 00:04:16.355
-Fascinating.

00:04:16.355 --> 00:04:19.324
-No, it's not fascinating.

00:04:19.324 --> 00:04:20.593
It's dangerous.

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:23.195
Someone just floated
an insane conspiracy theory

00:04:23.195 --> 00:04:25.298
on a channel watched by
millions of people,

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:29.835
and you're reacting like Spock
after a transporter malfunction.

00:04:29.835 --> 00:04:31.603
-Fascinating.

00:04:31.603 --> 00:04:34.940
-Now, Geraldo Rivera,
who claimed the bomb's a hoax,

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:37.175
did take it back
after an arrest was made,

00:04:37.175 --> 00:04:38.477
tweeting, "Never mind;

00:04:38.477 --> 00:04:41.347
outsmarted myself in conjuring
false flag operation

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.516
designed to hurt
Donald Trump and GOP".

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:45.151
That's how dumb Geraldo is.

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:49.688
He got outsmarted by Geraldo.

00:04:49.688 --> 00:04:52.058
And then there's Lou Dobbs,
the Fox Business host

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:53.826
who tweeted
"Fake news, fake bombs".

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:56.495
Dobbs might be the most unhinged
conspiracy theorist on Fox,

00:04:56.495 --> 00:04:57.663
which is saying a lot

00:04:57.663 --> 00:04:59.799
given that Fox also employees
this guy --

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:01.233
Sean Hannity is what you get

00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:04.237
if you gave Frankenstein
the brain of Alex Jones.

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:05.438
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.438 --> 00:05:07.640
But somehow Dobbs
has managed to out-crazy him,

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.841
and not only is the president

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:10.409
one of Dobbs'
most loyal viewers --

00:05:10.409 --> 00:05:12.745
he actually includes Dobbs
in major decisions.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:14.079
Earlier this year,
it was reported that

00:05:14.079 --> 00:05:16.515
Dobbs had been patched into
senior-level meetings

00:05:16.515 --> 00:05:17.716
that featured officials

00:05:17.716 --> 00:05:19.752
such as Senior Policy Advisor
Steven Miller

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.787
and former Chief Strategist
Steve Bannon.

00:05:21.787 --> 00:05:23.122
Man, it is not easy

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:24.690
to be the craziest person
in a meeting

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.625
with Steve Bannon
and Steven Miller.

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:28.694
Although in fairness to Dobbs,
when the meeting started,

00:05:28.694 --> 00:05:30.062
it was just supposed to
be Bannon,

00:05:30.062 --> 00:05:32.165
but then Miller
burst out of his chest.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.333
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:35.735
So, Dobbs --

00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:37.770
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:44.276 --> 00:05:46.211
So, Dobbs is one of many
prominent conservatives

00:05:46.211 --> 00:05:47.446
on TV and social media

00:05:47.446 --> 00:05:49.148
spreading baseless
conspiracy theories,

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:51.283
and even before
the suspect was identified,

00:05:51.283 --> 00:05:53.019
he was on TV blaming Democrats

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:55.053
for violence
against Republicans.

00:05:55.053 --> 00:05:57.623
Although watch as he tries to
get through this segment,

00:05:57.623 --> 00:06:00.026
has trouble reading,
and just gives up.

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:01.494
-Be sure to vote
in our poll tonight.

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:04.030
Do you believe it's time
for Democratic leaders

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.198
to denounce acts of violence

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:07.666
against Republicans

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:10.769
as President Trump --

00:06:10.769 --> 00:06:12.838
Targeted prominent, uh --

00:06:12.838 --> 00:06:15.040
Targeted, uh, Democrats --

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.977
Uh, cast your vote on Twitter
@LouDobbs.

00:06:17.977 --> 00:06:19.645
-Oh, my goodness.

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:22.515
Sounds like Grandpa
took too much Lunesta.

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:23.716
[ Laughter ]

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:26.385
"Grandpa! The bottle's empty".

00:06:26.385 --> 00:06:28.353
So, this is what the president
is consuming all day

00:06:28.353 --> 00:06:30.256
and then turning around
and spewing to his audience.

00:06:30.256 --> 00:06:32.224
In fact, just hours before
an arrest was made

00:06:32.224 --> 00:06:33.258
in the bombings on Friday,

00:06:33.258 --> 00:06:35.728
Trump went on Twitter to
again attack CNN,

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:38.964
which just days earlier had been
the target of a mail bomb.

00:06:38.964 --> 00:06:41.366
-"Funny how lowly rated CNN
and others

00:06:41.366 --> 00:06:43.268
can criticize me at will,

00:06:43.268 --> 00:06:45.871
even blaming me
for the current state of bombs

00:06:45.871 --> 00:06:48.908
and ridiculously comparing this
to September 11th

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:50.709
and the Oklahoma City bombing.

00:06:50.709 --> 00:06:52.544
Yet when I criticize them,

00:06:52.544 --> 00:06:55.614
they go wild and scream,
'It's just not presidential'".

00:06:55.614 --> 00:06:58.551
-That's because it's their job
to cover you.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:07:00.353
Your job is to be president.

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:02.522
They're two different jobs.

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:04.657
You're like a guy
who goes in for a checkup

00:07:04.657 --> 00:07:09.528
and says, "Funny how the doctor
can check my prostate,

00:07:09.528 --> 00:07:12.964
but if I try to check his,
I get arrested".

00:07:12.964 --> 00:07:15.768
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:17.669
But somehow --

00:07:17.669 --> 00:07:19.771
somehow,

00:07:19.771 --> 00:07:21.941
that wasn't even
the most disconcerting thing

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:23.042
about that tweet.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:25.711
It's that Trump tweeted it
at 3:14 A.M.

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.079
Why is the president
of the United States

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:28.113
up at 3:00 in the morning

00:07:28.113 --> 00:07:29.982
tweeting insults
about a news network?

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:31.083
If he's having trouble sleeping,

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:32.117
maybe he should try taking

00:07:32.117 --> 00:07:33.953
whatever medication
Lou Dobbs was on.

00:07:33.953 --> 00:07:35.221
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.221 --> 00:07:36.221
So, right-wing pundits,

00:07:36.221 --> 00:07:37.556
Fox News,
and the president himself

00:07:37.556 --> 00:07:38.824
spent days floating the theory

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:40.126
that the bombs
were a false flag,

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:41.894
but then when an arrest
was actually made,

00:07:41.894 --> 00:07:44.497
it turned out the only flag
the suspect was waving

00:07:44.497 --> 00:07:45.597
was a MAGA flag.

00:07:45.597 --> 00:07:47.366
-The person arrested today

00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:48.600
in Plantation, Florida,

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.803
is Cesar Sayoc.

00:07:50.803 --> 00:07:52.204
56 years old.

00:07:52.204 --> 00:07:55.174
-His Twitter feed showing him
driving to Trump rallies,

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:57.777
hosting crowd chants
attacking CNN...

00:07:57.777 --> 00:07:59.211
[ Chanting ]

00:07:59.211 --> 00:08:02.248
...cheering the president on
in this selfie video,

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:04.717
another recorded
as the president spoke.

00:08:04.717 --> 00:08:09.188
-This morning, the FBI seized
this white van owned by Sayoc

00:08:09.188 --> 00:08:12.358
that was covered
with pro-Trump stickers.

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:14.660
-This is his van.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.130
It is plastered with photos
of President Trump

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.599
and Vice President Pence.

00:08:19.599 --> 00:08:22.034
It shows pictures
of former President Obama

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:22.968
and Hillary Clinton,

00:08:22.968 --> 00:08:24.169
and it includes a sticker

00:08:24.169 --> 00:08:26.305
that is critical of CNN.

00:08:26.305 --> 00:08:27.739
-Man, I didn't think it
was possible

00:08:27.739 --> 00:08:29.575
to make a white van
even creepier,

00:08:29.575 --> 00:08:31.477
but he did it.

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:33.011
And yet, even after we found out

00:08:33.011 --> 00:08:34.680
that the suspect
was a Trump fan,

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:35.914
the president and his allies

00:08:35.914 --> 00:08:37.549
blamed
the recent spate of violence

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:38.784
on both sides.

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:41.153
-Everyone has their own style,

00:08:41.153 --> 00:08:43.022
and frankly, people
on both sides of the aisle

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:46.158
use strong language
about our political differences.

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:47.960
-America is polarized.
No doubt about it.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.596
-I mean, people are dug in
on both sides.

00:08:50.596 --> 00:08:53.565
-Angry obsessives are dangerous,
and they're in both fringes.

00:08:53.565 --> 00:08:56.535
-I would love to see the stuff
dial back on both sides.

00:08:56.535 --> 00:08:57.937
-It's not both sides.

00:08:57.937 --> 00:09:00.739
Only one side is repeating
deranged conspiracy theories

00:09:00.739 --> 00:09:02.307
accusing Democrats
of orchestrating

00:09:02.307 --> 00:09:03.342
an immigrant invasion,

00:09:03.342 --> 00:09:04.876
calling the press
the enemy of the people,

00:09:04.876 --> 00:09:06.211
and encouraging violence.

00:09:06.211 --> 00:09:09.314
Trump literally reenacted
a body slam against a reporter

00:09:09.314 --> 00:09:10.716
at one of his rallies.

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:12.951
Bernie Sanders
paused one of his rallies

00:09:12.951 --> 00:09:15.154
when a bird
landed on his podium.

00:09:15.154 --> 00:09:16.421
-Now, you see,

00:09:16.421 --> 00:09:20.092
this little bird
doesn't know it.

00:09:20.092 --> 00:09:23.128
Oh --
[ Cheers ]

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:26.131
-If that bird had landed
on Trump's podium,

00:09:26.131 --> 00:09:27.967
it would have ended up
in a bucket.

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:30.269
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:33.072
[ Applause ]

00:09:33.072 --> 00:09:34.840
Also --

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.142
Also,

00:09:37.142 --> 00:09:41.380
can I just ask why is
Anthony Scaramucci still on TV?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:42.815
If you're an ex-Trump aide,

00:09:42.815 --> 00:09:45.484
you shouldn't get more time
commenting on the White House

00:09:45.484 --> 00:09:48.487
than you had working inside
the White House.

00:09:48.487 --> 00:09:50.889
Scaramucci should have
been on TV for nine days max

00:09:50.889 --> 00:09:52.992
and then gone back
to what he was doing before,

00:09:52.992 --> 00:09:56.294
parking BMWs at Caesar's Palace.

00:09:56.294 --> 00:09:57.463
There's no use in waiting

00:09:57.463 --> 00:09:59.231
for moral leadership
from a president

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:01.266
who is so obviously unwilling
to provide it.

00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:03.903
The only option is to vote
for people who will,

00:10:03.903 --> 00:10:05.171
and maybe while we're at it,

00:10:05.171 --> 00:10:08.173
we can elect some people
who know how to use an umbrella.

00:10:08.173 --> 00:10:09.308
This has been "A Closer Look".

00:10:09.308 --> 00:10:11.911
[ Cheers and applause ]

